Alembic migrations for RAGOps.

The database URL is read from app.config.Settings in env.py, so migrations
honour the same environment variables and the same .env file as the server.
Nothing in this directory contains a credential.

From the repository root:

    alembic -c backend/alembic.ini upgrade head
    alembic -c backend/alembic.ini current
    alembic -c backend/alembic.ini downgrade -1
